# Finish setting up {{AGENT}}

Your SOUL and continuity files are ready. Follow the commands below to activate and verify them.

## Personal touches (optional)

Review `{{SOUL}}`. Only sections you deferred need `✎ EDIT` text filled in;
there is no fixed number of missing sections. Your selected traits and hobbies are already written.
The `COMPANION-SELF-AUTHORED` block is maintained by your companion.
You can also adjust `{{LIFE}}/routine.json`, or let the companion develop a routine.

The setup creates {{JOB_COUNT}} jobs. A successful installation check confirms the files,
hook and schedules; the execution history after a due time confirms whether a job actually ran.
